            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 504-CW, Mortise Lock Wrap-Around Plate for 86 Cut-Out</b>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Mortise Lock Wrap Around Plate has an 86 Edge (mortise) cut-out. It it typically used to cover an existing bore-hole or to help reinforce a damaged door. They can also be used to increase security at your home or office by protecting your doors from entry tools and tampering.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> of the Wrap Around 12-inch Mortise Security Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Face Plate Width: 5.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Edge Plate Width: 1.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Recess: 8\" x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 22 (.032 gauge) construction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-504-CW-specifications.pdf?v=1704262372\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 504-CW Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-504-CW-specifications.gif?v=1704354770\" width=\"209\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 504-CW Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
